    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I've always loved math and physics, finding them logical and beautiful. My background isn't strong academically, but I enjoy seeing how numbers make sense. It's been a reliable friend through my hobbies, helping me understand patterns in climbing and even yoga poses. Math gives me a sense of structure, unlike some subjects that just feel forced on me.",
